"Device class number" = "设备类型编号";
"Stored inside CacheData as an 8-byte number: 1 means iPhone, 3 means iPad. This is what makes apps choose phone or tablet layouts, and what iPadOS window features depend on." = "以 8 字节整数存在 CacheData 里：1 = iPhone，3 = iPad。它决定 App 用手机还是平板布局，也是 iPadOS 窗口功能的前提。";
"Tells the system this device is an iPad. iPad-only capabilities stay hidden until this flag exists, and it is normally paired with the iPad device class number." = "让系统认为这是一台 iPad。没有它，iPad 专属能力不会出现；通常与设备类型编号一起写。";
